{"schemaVersion":1,"id":459,"sections":[{"id":"1818001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20593],"start":0,"count":45},{"id":"1818001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20594],"start":45,"count":23}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:1","scriptId":20593,"text":"“咚咚咚……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:2","scriptId":20593,"text":"有人敲响了特别空勤队基地的大门。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:3","scriptId":20593,"text":"“来了，果然是兰布达，我想你也该来了，柔呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:4","scriptId":20593,"text":"因为这段日子兰布达和柔经常一起出现，所以今天没看到柔，我有点好奇便随口一问。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:5","scriptId":20593,"text":"“今天不是来搞RHO屋的，所以柔没来。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:6","scriptId":20593,"text":"“哦，这样啊，那兰布达你有什么事？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:7","scriptId":20593,"text":"“帮我看管一下这家伙。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:8","scriptId":20593,"text":"兰布达的手掌伸到了我的胸前，手掌上坐着一个我熟悉的家伙。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:9","scriptId":20593,"text":"“埃普西隆？？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:10","scriptId":20593,"text":"“哟……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:11","scriptId":20593,"text":"没想到兰布达会来找我寄放埃普西隆。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:12","scriptId":20593,"text":"“怎么了？之前不是已经恢复正常大小了吗？为什么又变回去了……？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:13","scriptId":20593,"text":"“这家伙……误喝了泰莱塔大人贮藏的浓缩血液。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:14","scriptId":20593,"text":"“然后就变这样了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:15","scriptId":20593,"text":"“她误喝倒也算了，再调制出来补上就行了。但这件事情最后还被泰莱塔大人发现了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:16","scriptId":20593,"text":"“然后呢？误喝的话，道个歉就行了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:17","scriptId":20593,"text":"“于是泰莱塔大人一怒之下把埃普西隆给放逐了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:18","scriptId":20593,"text":"“泰莱塔的权利还真是大，那如果让艾丽莎或者赛琳娜把埃普西隆接回去不就好了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:19","scriptId":20593,"text":"“这样做确实可以，但现在我找不到艾丽莎大人和赛琳娜大人……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:20","scriptId":20593,"text":"“嗯？是出了什么事吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:21","scriptId":20593,"text":"“那两位大人目前沉迷旅行中……伪装身份的状态下，我根本找不到她们两个……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:22","scriptId":20593,"text":"“这样啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:23","scriptId":20593,"text":"（不过话说回来，我倒是有办法联络艾丽莎。但为了这种事情就用掉的话，好像不太合适……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:24","scriptId":20593,"text":"“嗯？你怎么了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:25","scriptId":20593,"text":"感觉我在想事情的兰布达问道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:26","scriptId":20593,"text":"“那你的意思是，要把埃普西隆放我这里？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:27","scriptId":20593,"text":"“嗯，因为给她喝了缩小身体的原液，所以她比之前老实了。”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:28","scriptId":20593,"text":"“放波西娅那里的话，我也不太放心，所以先放你这里吧，毕竟这个形态下的埃普西隆已经没什么危险性了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:29","scriptId":20593,"text":"“她能打得过老鼠吗？在基地里抓抓老鼠应该不错。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:30","scriptId":20593,"text":"“使用能力的话应该可以轻松获胜。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:31","scriptId":20593,"text":"埃普西隆一脸得意。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:32","scriptId":20593,"text":"“还是算了吧，这里的老鼠到了晚上都是成群出现的……我估计你可能会成为它们的点心。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":853,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:33","scriptId":20593,"text":"“什么！？竟然还集群出现……犯规啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":853,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:34","scriptId":20593,"text":"“因为泰莱塔大人命令的关系，我也没办法包庇这家伙，所以就只能拜托你了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:35","scriptId":20593,"text":"看看埃普西隆又看看兰布达，这也不是个很难的选择题。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:36","scriptId":20593,"text":"“反正也就是喂她点废料零件就能过活的，我想没什么问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:37","scriptId":20593,"text":"“哼，不给我好吃的，我可要在你们基地里捣乱！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:38","scriptId":20593,"text":"我一把从兰布达的手里提起埃普西隆。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:39","scriptId":20593,"text":"“捣乱的话，我就把你送去给波西娅~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":853,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:40","scriptId":20593,"text":"“啊！卑鄙小人，竟然威胁我！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":853,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:41","scriptId":20593,"text":"“我想你应该会喜欢波西娅的新手术台~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":853,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":853,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:42","scriptId":20593,"text":"“好吧……我会安分……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":853,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:43","scriptId":20593,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:44","scriptId":20593,"text":"或许是看到我对付埃普西隆很有一套，所以兰布达看上去表情有些缓和。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-PROLOGUE:20593:45","scriptId":20593,"text":"“那这个家伙就交给你了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:1","scriptId":20594,"text":"从兰布达的手里收下埃普西隆之后，第一个需要报告的人自然就是特别空勤队的负责人——亚当斯·哈柏林。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:2","scriptId":20594,"text":"“这东西就是旅行者埃普西隆？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:3","scriptId":20594,"text":"亚当斯打算伸手去摸桌子上的埃普西隆——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":855,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:4","scriptId":20594,"text":"“吓——！！滚开！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":855,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:5","scriptId":20594,"text":"没想到埃普西隆摆出一副不可接近的样子，还把亚当斯吓了一条。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":855,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:6","scriptId":20594,"text":"“小东西还挺凶。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":855,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:7","scriptId":20594,"text":"亚当斯缩回了手，不过眼睛还是紧紧盯着埃普西隆。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":855,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:8","scriptId":20594,"text":"“我想你可能也知道，之前在死水的时候，我和旅行者打过点交道。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:9","scriptId":20594,"text":"虽然不是故意炫耀，但是我把手伸向埃普西隆的时候，她就靠了过来，很自然地跳了上去。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:10","scriptId":20594,"text":"这一动作把亚当斯羡慕的……连我都能感觉到他神色的变化。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:11","scriptId":20594,"text":"“嗯……也可以吧，如果她能提供点旅行者的情报就再好不过了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:12","scriptId":20594,"text":"“她啊？您还是放弃吧，这家伙除了吃几乎没有任何可取之处了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:13","scriptId":20594,"text":"我拿出一个螺帽放到手上，埃普西隆见状一个飞扑抱住螺帽开始啃咬起来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:14","scriptId":20594,"text":"“怎么像花栗鼠……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:15","scriptId":20594,"text":"“大概就是这么个家伙。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:16","scriptId":20594,"text":"“好、好吧，我知道了。如果你担保她不惹麻烦的话就批准了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:17","scriptId":20594,"text":"“谢谢，亚当斯长官。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:18","scriptId":20594,"text":"“这东西要给她搭个小屋吗？可能会和花栗鼠饲养箱差不多。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:19","scriptId":20594,"text":"“哦？要给我搭小屋？好啊，尽量弄的舒适点。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":854,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:20","scriptId":20594,"text":"没想到埃普西隆对亚当斯的提议很满意。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":854,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:21","scriptId":20594,"text":"“不，这家伙的话——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:22","scriptId":20594,"text":"“好，我这就去弄~！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1818001-EPILOGUE:20594:23","scriptId":20594,"text":"（总觉得亚当斯长官好像很喜欢埃普西隆的样子……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
